  "3216|13f1d3f9": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Neeru Fireblade",
   "npc": "3216",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Listen closely to what you are told and do not quickly trust, or distrust.  For even friends serve their own ends, $c.\n\nOur great Warchief knows this, and to prove that there are warlocks within the Horde who do not wish to destroy it from within or gain control over it, I have volunteered to aid our young leader in anyway I can.",
   "time": 1793850826,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3216|1672ee12": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Neeru Fireblade",
   "npc": "3216",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Naive fool. The Burning Blade IS the Shadow Council! There are many cults and organizations under the Council's rule, but all of them are just extensions of their will. I may lead the Burning Blade, but I am still just as much a pawn to the Council as you are to me!\n\nLook at the Searing Blade--most of them think they are becoming the next rising group of powerful warlocks that they will replace the Shadow Council.",
   "time": 1793850820,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3216|2e9c14b6": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Neeru Fireblade",
   "npc": "3216",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Haha! Save for their leaders--the satyr, Bazzalan, and the warlock Jergosh--yes, all of them. That is why I constantly send Thrall's worshippers at them. It gives Thrall the impression that I am weeding out the evil in the bowels of his great city. The victory is in reality two-fold: kill Thrall's faithful and test the strength of those in the Searing Blade to see if they are truly worthy of joining me.",
   "time": 1793850823,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3216|9353e287": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Neeru Fireblade",
   "npc": "3216",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Ah, one of our own. It is good to see our numbers are growing so rapidly that I can no longer keep track of the faces of our members.\n\nThat fool Thrall thinks I am working hard to cleanse the image of warlocks and prove we are his servants. Idiot! The Burning Legion will make ash of this entire world after it drains it completely.",
   "time": 1793850819,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3216|e0c203bc": {
   "build": "70790",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Neeru Fireblade",
   "npc": "3216",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I will make it known to you. You are obviously already proving yourself in our ranks to become a lieutenant so quickly. Perhaps you can return to me later and I will have tasks for you. The council adores those skilled in the arcane, but servants of all kinds are always welcome, no matter their profession.",
   "time": 1793850824,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
